    style="width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%;">
    
  <div style="background-color: #B7E0E5; padding: 15px; font-size: 16px; max-width: 600px; border-radius: 10px;">
    “Can you break this problem into smaller parts?”
  </div>
</div>

</div>

These prompts help students build stronger reasoning habits while developing a more thoughtful understanding of AI systems.

### Heads Up!

You'll see a quick check for understanding about computational thinking on the next page. Feel free to come back to this page to review this information.
